{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/78671-writer-all-call-follow-up","id":78671,"title":"Writer All-Call: Follow Up","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Onyx Path Announcements"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-24T15:10:09-08:00","id":78671,"title":"Writer All-Call: Follow Up","content":"The all-call (you know, this thing) is going well. We&#8217;ve got a few dozen submissions so far, and I&#8217;m looking forward to reading through them snagging some new folks for whatever the heck my next project turns out to be. We have had a few questions that come up often enough to merit this post,&#8230;<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/writer-all-call-follow-up/\" target=\"_blank\">More...</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Onyx Path</b><br /> This is an automated forum administration account. If you need to contact an administrator, use the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Us link</a> rather than PMing this account.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1-forum-administrator","name":"Forum Administrator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Automated Account","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T09:01:46-08:00","id":79356,"title":"","content":"Re: Fiction vs Game prose. Does that mean you're looking for fiction that illustrates how a particular mechanic might work out? For example, if I submit a short story featuring an Idigam, would you want me to write it in such a way that I show STs and players how a particular power(s) of the Idigam would translate into the narrative from the rules?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://for